    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE NEON SQUAD TACTICS COMMUNITY</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based tactics strategy game with a compelling single-player campaign and drop in / drop out multiplayer missions for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 31 playfields across 3 diverse biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose from 9 playable Squad members - Floor Model / Assassin / Vanguard / Ravager / Juggernaut / E-Goop / Ghost / Queen / Wildcard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over-the-top futuristic weaponry includes laser swords, combat drones, lightning launchers, smart mines, nano-bots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wagering system. The bigger the risks, the bigger the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy drinks at the bar. Throw them on the battlefield for added buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hyper-retro 90s aesthetic and a modern synthwave soundtrack featuring tracks by AM0k, Metasphere, Fynn\u2019s Arcade, Hearts in Beta and Monster Mansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998650/extras/d6025805f293c579e9f62c406053fd8a.avif?t=1733284939\" width=600 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Turn-based tactics strategy game with a compelling single-player campaign and drop in / drop out multiplayer missions for up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 31 playfields across 3 diverse biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose from 9 playable Squad members - Floor Model / Assassin / Vanguard / Ravager / Juggernaut / E-Goop / Ghost / Queen / Wildcard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over-the-top futuristic weaponry includes laser swords, combat drones, lightning launchers, smart mines, nano-bots, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wagering system. The bigger the risks, the bigger the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy drinks at the bar. Throw them on the battlefield for added buffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hyper-retro 90s aesthetic and a modern synthwave soundtrack featuring tracks by AM0k, Metasphere, Fynn\u2019s Arcade, Hearts in Beta and Monster Mansion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998650/extras/d6025805f293c579e9f62c406053fd8a.avif?t=1733284939\" width=600 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
